### Research trail (why this is excluded)

1. Three web searches on 2026-10-27 (`"OWO 2.5" OR "OWO-2.5" AI model LLM release benchmarks` — only a 1980 university yearbook OCR artifact; `"owo" language model huggingface openweights release 2026 lab` — only OwOllama-v0.1; `"OWO" OpenRouter anonymous codename / artificial analysis / vals` — nothing) surfaced **zero** model releases, weights, provider listings, or benchmark tables for an "OwO" model family, at any version.
2. The name is internet onomatopoeia ("owo" face) — the only AI artifacts bearing it are novelty fine-tunes and meme-adjacent tooling, which is the likely roster-contamination source. There is no vendor, lab, or repository that has shipped a model line called OwO with a 2.x version.
3. Anonymous OpenRouter codenames (e.g. "Hunter Alpha") exist in this era, but no codename "OWO" was ever indexed by OpenRouter-tracking outlets.
4. Per contract: zero verified public benchmark numbers → `.md.excluded`, never invented numbers. The pre-existing `average.md` in this folder could not have come from a real `owo-2.5` evaluation and should be reviewed by the project owner.

